### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth
@accessToken =
@refreshToken =

### ===========================
### REGISTER
### ===========================

### Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ===========================
### EMAIL VERIFICATION
### ===========================

### Verify email (replace token with value from email/log)
GET {{baseUrl}}/verify-email?token=REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### Resend verification email
POST {{baseUrl}}/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### ===========================
### LOGIN
### ===========================

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ===========================
### AUTHENTICATED REQUESTS
### ===========================

### Get current user info
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===========================
### TOKEN
### ===========================

### Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ===========================
### LOGOUT
### ===========================

### Logout current session
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout all sessions
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
